WEBVTT

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:14.490
My darling Luvellia is drifting away from my side...

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:20.670
Unacceptable!

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:25.350
Guildmaster, a missive has arrived...

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:40.870
With this, you shall meet your demise... Peter Grill!

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:54.910
The chance to be a hero is long gone...

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:00.960
Dug myself into a hole with no way out

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:05.460
Back against the wall...

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.300
I mean, how could I resist?

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.010
"This wasn't supposed to happen,"

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:10.590
I keep denying

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:12.050
I wish I could just disappear...

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:13.220
I wish I could just disappear...

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:13.720
I wish I could just disappear...

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:16.680
I can't stand myself

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:20.100
Moping around, spouting lies, grieving a broken heart

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:23.060
I hold on desperately to these feelings and shut my eyes

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.520
So why does this stupid guilt refuse to go away!?

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.520
So why does this stupid guilt refuse to go away!?

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:30.150
I suffocate under its weight

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:34.070
The chance to be a hero is long gone...

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:37.490
Always discouraged by my weaknesses,

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:40.700
I drop to my knees and grovel at your feet,

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.710
clinging selfishly to the hope for forgiveness

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:47.040
Dug myself into a hole with no way out...

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:50.300
Full of regret and powerless to change,

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:53.550
I feel my heart being torn apart

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:57.300
on this night of endless shame and despair

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:06.520
Why can't I get my act together?

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:12.650
Got nothing but this pathetic self of mine...

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:17.530
Marriage... proposal?

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:18.840
Precisely.

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:25.830
Episode       Peter Grill and a Blind Date with an Orc

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:24.270
We have received a missive from Orcland
requesting access to your future offspring.

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:28.660
Having witnessed your performance in
the Grand Fighting Tournament,

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:31.340
a member of the Orc aristocracy named
Mr. Babe has come forth with a direct offer.

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:35.760
But Luvellia-senpai and I already pledged ourselves–!

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:37.590
Father!

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.050
What in the world is the meaning of this!?

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.700
The Guild recognized my engagement to Peter-kun.

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:45.340
A marriage proposal!? Now, of all times!?

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:47.860
Calm yourself, Luvellia.

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:50.360
Consider this nothing more than a formality.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.150
If I may be so bold,

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:56.390
the nobility hailing from Great Orcland and
the southern United Pork Pie Kingdom

00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:59.320
are some of our Guild's most influential patrons.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.670
Due to the substantial monetary
contributions they provide,

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:05.040
it would be unwise to decline their request outright.

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:09.380
So as not to disgrace our esteemed allies,
we must adhere to the standard protocol.

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:13.160
After that, etiquette dictates a polite refusal.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.300
Please, Guildmaster...!

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:17.560
Is there some sort of problem?

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:21.120
As Luvellia's loyal fiancé,
you don't intend to become emotionally

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:24.620
attached to this potential marriage partner, do you?

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:27.890
No, I would never dream of such a thing...

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:31.780
I'm well aware of what you're trying to pull, Father.

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:34.320
However, you're wasting your time.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:40.100
The idea of Peter-kun betraying
my trust is simply preposterous!

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:43.190
Layonnaise!

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:45.210
The pain...

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:46.620
My heart can't take this...!

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:47.800
Senpai!

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.000
One little swimmer...

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.210
What about <i>me!?</i>

00:03:56.090 --> 00:04:01.000
It was exceedingly generous of you
to entertain our unusual request.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.990
We are most appreciative!

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:06.280
This marriage proposal is of great significance to us.

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:14.760
It presents an opportunity to reinforce the relationship
between Orcland and the Yakeppachi Warriors Guild.

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:18.190
Great minds think alike!

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:23.880
This whole blind date thing is clearly a trap...

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:28.540
However, the Guildmaster has failed
to consider one crucial detail.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:29.920
It's true...

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:32.380
Looks aren't everything, but...

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:37.630
That ain't gonna happen!

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.340
You! Go and fetch Piglette.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.630
Did he say "Piglette"!?

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:50.480
Humans and Orcs are two distinct cultures.

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:54.040
Each has a vastly different concept of ideal beauty.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:58.480
If I had to guess, the Guildmaster's goal is to
trick me into causing some sort of scandal.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.480
But this time, I have total confidence!

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:04.740
Oink...!

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:08.450
Me, fall for an Orc? No way in...

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:09.200
...hell!?

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:19.210
P-Piglette Pancetta, at your service.

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:26.180
Sh-She's cute!?

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:34.300
Now then, get to know one another.
Let your friendship blossom.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:45.660
The old bastard set me up...!

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:48.740
I already know where this is going...

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:49.900
Man milk!

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:51.370
Oink!

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:00.340
I-Is she about to give birth!?

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.800
Uh... Are you okay?

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.620
F-Forgive me...

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:06.010
I-It's just...

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:11.120
I've never spoken to a man this much in my life...

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.890
But we've barely said two words to each other!

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.110
S-Sorry...

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:25.750
Guildmaster, a young lady such as she...

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:28.070
Fret not, Goodman...

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:31.020
Guildmaster!

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:32.690
My apologies for the delay.

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:35.210
I've brought the Goon Squad Trio, as you requested.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:39.170
Goon Squad Trio!?

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:45.290
I was employed as a servant by Master Babe.

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:48.790
One day, I suddenly found myself
swept up in talks of marriage...

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:50.500
Does that mean...

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:52.640
You're not on board with this whole thing?

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:57.420
Y-You see, I'm merely doing as Master Babe instructed...

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:00.950
However...

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:07.390
Your breathtaking performance at the tournament
is burned into my memories even now, Sir Peter.

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:14.250
Offering a repulsive woman like
me to a noble man like you...

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:15.520
It's...!

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:17.960
Repulsive!? You!?

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:20.900
I'm an outcast in Orc society.

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:25.470
My entire life, I've been treated like garbage
for having the appearance of a Human...

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.090
I'm sorry!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:31.070
Only a fool would be seen with a hideous Orc like me...!

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:32.500
Wait!

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:40.360
P-Pardon me...

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:43.300
Hey there, sweet cheeks!

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:47.860
If you ain't got nowhere to be,
how's about joinin' us for a bite to eat?

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:50.630
Let us show you a good time...

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:52.870
U-Um...

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:54.000
No, thank you.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:55.370
I...

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:56.540
Hey, back off!

00:07:57.390 --> 00:07:59.410
S-Sir Peter...?

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.840
Piglette-san, stay behind me.

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:03.540
The hell's your problem!?

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.710
Dammit! Yer pissin' me off!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:07.470
It's slaughter time, boys!

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:15.720
Now's our chance!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:25.360
Th-Thank you, Sir Peter...
for rescuing such an ugly woman...

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.220
You aren't ugly at all.

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:33.350
That might be the case in the Orc world,
but let's get one thing straight:

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.870
By Human standards, you're really cute.

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:38.550
C-C-C-Cu...!?

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:47.460
So have a little more confidence in yourself, okay?

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:49.260
Oh, my bad.

00:08:55.370 --> 00:09:01.680
W-Well then, could we take a tour of the town together...?

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:02.720
Of course!

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:12.280
How beautiful...!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.820
I've always wanted to visit a Human city.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:22.500
I figured that it might be easier for
a hideous woman like myself...

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:25.380
To blend in, you know?

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.380
That was a blast!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.460
Out with it, you two.

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:41.850
Were you able to connect with
each other on a deeper level?

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.130
With all due respect, I must speak my mind.

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:49.020
This marriage proposal is nothing more
than a ploy to score political points.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:52.400
The intentions of those involved
are not being taken into account.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:59.290
I believe Miss Piglette feels likewise and
would prefer not to proceed any further.

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:02.140
Does he speak the truth, Piglette?

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:04.040
W-Well, I...

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:06.370
Now then, if you'll excuse me...

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.050
How rude!

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:11.380
Leaving your seat before our esteemed
guest has a chance to respond?

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.580
Where are your manners!?

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:20.050
Perhaps the two of you have not had enough time
to gain an intimate understanding of one another...

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:22.770
Don't you agree, Piglette?

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:28.480
What the hell...?

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:30.430
Guildmaster!

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:34.070
If you spend one night in this room,
at least we can say that we tried.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:37.240
Though a mere formality,
we must be sure to cover all our bases.

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:40.870
I sincerely hope that you refrain
from making an error in judgement...

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:40.990
I sincerely hope that you refrain
from making an error in judgement...

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:41.120
I sincerely hope that you refrain
from making an error in judgement...

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:41.240
I sincerely hope that you refrain
from making an error in judgement...

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:41.370
I sincerely hope that you refrain
from making an error in judgement...

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:43.980
Oh crap...

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:45.620
This is bad...!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:51.210
Sir Peter...

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.050
It started out as a simple crush

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:06.100
Suddenly, you were my biggest source of strength

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.730
Till death do us part, let's grow old together

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:11.980
This is my sincerest wish:

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.070
Stay with me, stay with me

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:17.740
So long time, by my side for all eternity

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:20.950
Beaten down by our daily struggles

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:23.370
Or soaked by a storm of rage;

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:26.330
If you get drenched, I won't hesitate

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.710
To be the umbrella that shields you

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:31.420
It's not so cold... I'm by your side

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:33.880
That's good enough for me

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:37.050
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:40.930
That smile of yours puts my soul at ease

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:43.340
I could search the whole world over

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:45.430
And find no one like you

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:48.430
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:52.400
Just the sight of you fills my heart with joy

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:54.610
No matter how much it may hurt,

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:57.650
I pledge my life to protecting you

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:02.830
Dear Sir Peter Grill,

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:06.420
Between your fortitude and ingenuity,
nobody can catch you off guard.

00:12:06.420 --> 00:12:09.240
That's the beauty of being the strongest man alive, eh?

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:09.920
Episode       Peter Grill and the Orc's True Character
